      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.45 (up from ₹2.97 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹68.7m (up 116% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹14.5m (up 16% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 21% (down from 39% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 5% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 151% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
